        "urduTitle": "مرکزی عصبی نظام",
        "text": "Parasympathetic Division (dominates during times of \"rest and rumination\"; directs maintenance activities)\n\nCentral nervous system consists of brain and spinal cord, both act as coordinating centers, but brain is involved more in coordination than spinal cord. Spinal cord also acts as a link between PNS and brain.",
