        "heading": "21.7 AGING",
        "title": "21.7 AGING",
        "headingUrdu": "بوڑھاپنا",
        "headingPashto": "زوړوالی",
        "urduTitle": "بوڑھاپنا",
        "text": "Usually aging refers to the physiologic changes that occur in all individuals due to age. The sequence of the changes is consistent among all people, the rate, however, can differ greatly. Both genetics and environment impact age-related changes. Siblings with the same genetic background can have marked differences in longevity due to environmental factors or secondary aging. The causes of secondary aging may be preventable.",
