        "urduTitle": "ڈی این ای تجزیے کے استعمال",
        "text": "Today DNA analysis has wide range of application in different fields of life. It can be used to: • Identify potential suspects whose DNA may match evidence left at crime scenes bands visible through autoradiography.\n\n• Exonerate persons wrongly accused of crimes\n\n• Identify crime and catastrophe victims\n\n• Establish paternity and other family relationships\n\n• Identify endangered and protected species as an aid to wildlife officials (could be used for prosecuting poachers)\n\nDetect bacteria and other organisms that may pollute air, water, soil, and food Match organ donors with recipients in transplant programs\n\n• Determine pedigree for seed or livestock breeds",
